+// k360RawCiphers lists the 360 Browser 7.5 legacy cipher suites in emission
+// order. Only the AES-CBC suites are implemented by BoringSSL; everything
+// else (DHE, DSS, RC4, 3DES, CBC-SHA256) is emitted as raw IDs for
